				//! <Function Comment="Circular movement in the coordinate system given by the Server SetCoordSystem with 2 or 3 coupled axes, the other coupled axes execute a linear movement&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;With function CircleDefinition you define the 2 axis for the circular movement.&#13;&#10;default setting is axis1 and axis2&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;This method is only allowed to be called from a thread running on the same Core as the Realtime Thread for the _LMCProfile instance which has an equal or lower priority than the Realtime Thread." Name="MoveCircle"/>
