				//! <Function Comment="The method MoveCurve executes a combined motion, which can easily implemented in for example, a Pick-and-Place application. &#13;&#10;The motion consists of up to 5 motion phases (see documentation). &#13;&#10;With the transfer parameter pObstacle^.AxisNr the number of the axis has to be selected, which executes the evasive movement. " Name="MoveCurveSpline"/>
	FUNCTION VIRTUAL GLOBAL MoveCurveSpline
